# PreSpawnerSpawnEvent。スポナーが実体を作る直前。

file: net/minecraft/world/level/BaseSpawner.java
anchor:
                        Entity entity = EntityType.loadEntityRecursive(entityToSpawn, world, entity1 -> {
insert:
